Add bow and magic wand weapon decorations to the landing page

A single WeaponDecoration component handles all weapon logic: equip on
click, right-click anywhere to unequip, hover text, and a subtle radial
gradient aura (no blur/filter, so it never re-rasterises).

CursorStore (lib/cursor.ts) replaces the sword-specific sessionStorage
logic with a shared store that supports any weapon. One active weapon at a
time; equipping a new one automatically removes the previous cursor class.
SwordCursorInit now calls restoreFromStorage so all three weapons persist
across navigation.

SwordCursor is now a thin wrapper of WeaponDecoration.

Aura colours: sword = red, bow = blue, wand = green. All are radial
gradients with closest-side so they can never form a hard edge.

Cursors: bow_cursor.png (32px from bow.jpg), wand_cursor.png (32px drawn
in code — GDI+ cannot read AVIF).

